From 5d7e055b5f40f79bb06b15d7fbdf4a328c5cee3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jungwuk-ryu <vojougae35@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 05:21:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Metal: harden Desktop GL texture buffers on iOS

Use a standalone private texture-buffer mirror on iOS Simulator, where
MTLSimBuffer rejects buffer-backed linear texture views. Convert valid RGB32
source layouts to RGBA32 Metal storage, emit scalar textureSize helpers, and
keep source-buffer observation and logical sizes coherent across updates.

Also make Desktop GL texture-buffer validation version-correct and extend
host regression coverage for buffer updates, RGB32 formats, and
glTexBufferRange.
